      "privatePressure": "扣船会延误救命粮，放行又可能让买田先发生。",
      "keyLeverage": "临时扣船核验或为赈粮卸载担保",
      "defaultPrepare": "核验船单并准备担保卸粮",
      "defaultCommit": "允许粮食以赈灾借贷形式卸载",
      "dialogueSeeds": [
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n5.zhejiang_governor.01",
          "text": "“先核船单再卸粮；灾民等得急，也不能让买田合同借乱生效。”",
          "purpose": "PROBE_OR_FRAME",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.grain_fleet",
            "obj.fleet_contract_and_banners",
            "obj.governor_command_seal"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n5.zhejiang_governor.02",
          "text": "“总督担保只保这批粮用于所写用途，不保任何人口头改名。”",
          "purpose": "BARGAIN_OR_THREAT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.grain_fleet",
            "obj.fleet_contract_and_banners",
            "obj.governor_command_seal"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n5.zhejiang_governor.03",
          "text": "“灯笼可以留，契约必须摊开，二者若不一致便先扣船。”",
          "purpose": "HANDOFF_OR_COMMITMENT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.grain_fleet",
            "obj.fleet_contract_and_banners",
            "obj.governor_command_seal"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "privateOpening": "胡宗宪若先扣船核验，灾民要多等；若先卸粮，原买田合同可能立刻生效。总督担保只能覆盖写明的用途。",
